PART 2: STRICT EDUCATIONAL USE & COPYRIGHT WARNING
--------------------------------------------------
IMPORTANT NOTICE ON INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY AND THIRD-PARTY ASSETS:

1. Educational & Research Scope:
   This project is developed solely for educational, pedagogical, and technical
   research purposes. Its primary objectives are to investigate Content Delivery
   Network (CDN) caching behaviors, HTTP Range resumption protocols, automated
   asset dependency resolution via stylesheet parsing, and local build pipeline
   integrity verification.

